#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0132B expect=violation domain=ADLBC
#note "Row 1: BASE missing (lone .) while CHG populated -> first conjunct true, second true via the bare empty(BASE) leaf -> FIRES. Row 2: everything populated -> silent. Pin AVAL and CHG but NOT BASE (blank on the fired row canonicalises to null). The CHG column satisfies Requirements.Variables.Any [CHG, PCHG, R2BASE], so the rule binds; ⛔ AVAL and BASE are deliberately NOT in that facet (M2-D24) -- gating them would skip the rule on exactly this dataset."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 AVAL=10 CHG=5
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col BASE    type=Num
col CHG     type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 10 | . | 5
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | ALB | 10 | 4 | 6
